title: "scientific-figure: publication-grade figures for computational neuroscience and NeuroAI"
abstract: >-
  A Claude skill and standalone matplotlib library (sciplot) for journal-exact multi-panel
  figures, CVD-measured colour palettes, comp-neuro/NeuroAI panel recipes and automatic
  figure linting.
